# .dockerignore for the source-pulling build context under
# build_infrastructure/docker/build/ (Dockerfile + centos-samples.dockerfile,
# both built with `docker build ... ../../../`, so the context root is the repo root).
#
# These mirror .gitignore's BUILD-OUTPUT rules so host-built artifacts don't bloat
# the image or contaminate the in-container rebuild. Two deliberate differences:
#   1) dockerignore matching differs slightly from gitignore; patterns without a slash match at any depth,
#      but we often prefix with **/ to make “match anywhere” intent explicit;
#   2) we ignore host-built *.a/*.so* outputs, but re-include the downloaded `make preparation` inputs
#      (prebuilt/, external/toolset, ipp libs+headers, emm symlinks, cbor copy):
#      the build COPYs a *prepared* tree and needs them.

# VCS metadata and docs (not needed in the image)
**/.git*
*.md

# Docker scaffolding (Dockerfiles are passed via -f, not consumed from context)
build_infrastructure/docker/
build_infrastructure/linux/installer/docker/

# Compiled objects and generated Edger8r proxies (regenerated in-container)
**/*.o
**/*_u.c
**/*_u.h
**/*_t.c
**/*_t.h

# Host-compiled static/shared libs: the container recompiles everything, so drop
# them. `make preparation` does NOT compile -- it only downloads/extracts prebuilt
# libs into four fixed roots, which we re-include so the in-container build (which
# does NOT re-run preparation) still has them:
#   external/ippcp_internal/lib  -- prebuilt IPP crypto (libippcp.a)
#   external/libm                -- prebuilt optimized math (SVML, Libm_ct)
#   external/libirc              -- prebuilt Intel runtime-compat lib
#   prebuilt/                    -- prebuilt DCAP OpenSSL
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.so.*
!external/ippcp_internal/lib/**
!external/libm/**
!external/libirc/**
!prebuilt/**

# Out-of-tree / top-level build output dirs
**/_build/
/build/

# Installer-staged package output (rebuilt in-container)
build_infrastructure/linux/installer/common/**/output/

# Autotools / libtool / automake outputs
**/.deps/
**/.libs/
**/*.lo
**/*.la
**/*.lai
**/.dirstamp
**/*.stamp

# CMake outputs
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/compile_commands.json
**/install_manifest.txt
**/CMakeLists.txt.user
**/CMakeUserPresets.json
**/CTestTestfile.cmake
**/Testing/
**/_deps/
**/cmake-build/

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Orphaned GNU binutils temp files (ar/objcopy/strip "stXXXXXX")
**/st[0-9A-Za-z][0-9A-Za-z][0-9A-Za-z][0-9A-Za-z][0-9A-Za-z][0-9A-Za-z]

# IDE / editor
**/.vs
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.cache/

# Merge/backup leftovers
**/*.orig
**/*.diff
**/*.BASE.*
**/*.LOCAL.*
**/*.REMOTE.*
**/*.BACKUP.*
**/*.bak

# Temp / log / swap / OS cruft
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

